Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: `DBConnection` has no method `execute`
  --> tests/ui/fix_points_to_the_real_api.jet:5:10
    |
  5 |     conn.execute("CREATE TABLE t (x INTEGER)")
    |          ^^^^^^^
 Why: `DBConnection` is a protected Core type with a closed method surface
 Fix: `execute` is on `DBScope`, which `.with_policy(…)` returns: write `.with_policy(…).execute(…)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102

Error [jet.UnknownName]: Nothing named `True` exists here
  --> tests/ui/fix_points_to_the_real_api.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     flag: True
    |           ^^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Jet writes this Bool value as `true`: replace `True` with `true`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107

Error [jet.UnknownName]: Nothing named `BigInt` exists here
  --> tests/ui/fix_points_to_the_real_api.jet:8:12
    |
  8 |     count: BigInt.parse("12")
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Jet's `Int` is exact at any size: replace `BigInt` with `Int`, as in `Int.parse(text)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107

Error [jet.UnknownName]: Nothing named `null` exists here
  --> tests/ui/fix_points_to_the_real_api.jet:10:14
    |
 10 |     nothing: null
    |              ^^^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: Jet writes no value as `None`: replace `null` with `None`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107

Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: Nothing named `println` exists here
  --> tests/ui/fix_points_to_the_real_api.jet:12:5
    |
 12 |     println("hi")
    |     ^^^^^^^
 Why: Only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print` / `panic`) can be called
 Fix: Did you mean `print`?
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
